        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p01c14" value="职责：持有本体/精神体、阶段、模式、认知、地图、背包；唯一解释死亡和&#10;形态结果。&#10;BeginExploration() / TryChangeForm()&#10;TryResetTrial() / TryTeleportMap()&#10;BeginEnvironmentEdit()&#10;ConfirmEnvironmentEdit()：确认草稿&#10;ReceiveDeath()：按阶段处理同一周期" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#23354a;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="666" y="242" width="508" height="185" as="geometry" />
