        <mxCell id="p09c59" value="Binding是EntityEnvironmentContext的私有登记单：只记移速/流速/动态力是否登记及参数版本，不持ForceData。源或实体停用都走Detach，退出不清真实惯性。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff4df;strokeColor=#e0bc7b;fontColor=#23354a;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;spacing=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
